= Rafael Vidiella

Vidiella is a leader of the Catalan socialists and the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s chief link to the Generalitat and the Catalan republican left. A reformist, he works to bind the Republic's regions and its parties together.

- @coalition
- @regional_affairs
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Vidiella can smooth our relations with the republican coalition and the Catalan left.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (psoe_in_government or in_republican_socialist or in_popular_front)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not (psoe_in_government or in_republican_socialist or in_popular_front) : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in a governing coalition. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if psoe_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; izq_rep_relation += 5; radical_relation += 2; izq_rep_relation += 2 if catalan_autonomy >= 1

We have smoothed our relations with <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> and the Catalan republicans, and reduced tensions within the coalition.

@regional_affairs
title: The Generalitat
subtitle: Through his ties to the Generalitat, Vidiella can advance the Statute of Autonomy and Catalan self-government.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; catalan_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: catalan_affairs

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Vidiella" and president != "Vidiella" : Vidiella must head the government or hold the presidency. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if president = "Vidiella" and presidential_powers : We have removed this power from the president with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Vidiella" or (president == "Vidiella" and not presidential_powers))
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
